  :first-run-was-not-clean
  "The first controls run reported 3 of 4. The fourth was DETECTED but the
   verifier printed only its first three sample failures, which were all
   :level-scale, so the driver could not see that :ac-qmul had failed too and
   reported the control as unproven rather than as met. The verifier now
   prints a FAILING-GROUPS line carrying every failing group. Recorded because
   the near-miss is the point: the control caught a hole in the REPORTING, and
   a driver that had grepped for 'did it go red' instead of 'did it go red for
   this reason' would have called it a pass."}

