  :reading "one transform kernel running JVM-free does not make the decoder
            JVM-free. What remains is exactly the part this kernel's shape
            cannot reach: picture assembly moves planes, and a plane is bulk
            data, for which the guest value model has no carrier. A 256x256
            luma plane exactly exhausts the native arena; 1920x1080 exceeds it
            thirtyfold. Closing the rest is a value-model problem, not a
            translation problem."}}
